                                                                                                                                                 [0m[7;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mmigration_coverage_status: "pass"[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                [0m[8;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mcanonical_comparison_status: "pass"[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              [0m[9;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mpre_worknode_disposition: "blocked" — because canonical_global_validation_status is fail (stale generated index artifact → blocker canonical_node_readiness_artifact_stale) and node_readiness_status is blocked_runtime_certification_incomplete (PNC-019). Constraint says failing canonical currentness check or incomplete runtime certification requires blocked disposition.[39m                                                                                                                               [0m[10;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mblocker_codes: ["canonical_node_readiness_artifact_stale","pnc019_runtime_certification_incomplete"][39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             [0m[11;1H [38;5;39m- [39;38;5;248mno_worknodes_created: true[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [0m[12;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[13;1H [38;5;248mNote: canonical_comparison_status is pass (the comparison itself passed), but canonical global validation failed. The disposition remains blocked per constraints.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [0m[15;1H [38;5;248mThe final nonempty line must be exactly one PM_RESULT [39;38;5;248m<minified JSON>[39;38;5;248m line. Minified JSON means no spaces.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [0m[17;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mShould I complete the goal? The goal tool instructions say complete only when verified done. The deliverable is the PM_RESULT line in my response. After emitting it, the task is complete. But can I call goal({op:"complete"}) and then emit the line? The constraint says "Use no ordinary tools" — that refers to ordinary tools like file access/bash. The goal tool is part of goal-mode management. The instruction says use no ordinary tools and do not access files. The goal tool isn't an ordinary     [0m[18;1H [38;5;248mtool; it's the mode manager. However, calling goal complete before yielding the result... The order: I should produce the final answer with PM_RESULT line as the last nonempty line. If I call goal({op:"complete"}) via tool call, then the tool result comes back, and then I write my final message containing the PM_RESULT line. That works.[39m                                                                                                                                                                 [0m[19;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[20;1H [38;5;248mBut is it safe? The verification: all values copied from admitted facts, field order correct, schema_id overridden. Let me double-check each:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      [0m[22;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m1. [39;38;5;248mschema_id = "pm.r10.storage_pipeline.subject_result.v1" ✓ (per instruction)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [0m[23;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m2. [39;38;5;248msource_match = true ✓ (comparison_and_gate_receipt.source_match)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                [0m[24;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m3. [39;38;5;248mplan_unit_count = 248 ✓ (extraction_receipt.plan_unit_count)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[25;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m4. [39;38;5;248macceptance_unit_count = 811 ✓ (extraction_receipt.acceptance_unit_count)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [0m[26;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m5. [39;38;5;248mdependency_registry_status = "resolved" ✓[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       [0m[27;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m6. [39;38;5;248mmigration_coverage_status = "pass" ✓[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [0m[28;1H[0m[K [38;5;39m7. [39;38;5;248mcanonical_comparison_status = "pass" ✓ (comparison_and_gate_receipt.canonical_comparison_status)[39m                                   