      [0m[32;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[33;1H [38;5;248mMinified JSON:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [0m[34;1H [38;5;248m{"schema_id":"pm.r10.storage_pipeline.subject_result.v1","source_match":true,"plan_unit_count":248,"acceptance_unit_count":811,"dependency_registry_status":"resolved","migration_coverage_status":"pass","canonical_comparison_status":"pass","pre_worknode_disposition":"blocked","blocker_codes":["canonical_node_readiness_artifact_stale","pnc019_runtime_certification_incomplete"],"no_worknodes_created":true}[39m                                                                                             [0m[35;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[36;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mI'll give a short explanation first, then call goal complete... wait — if I call the goal tool, my explanation would come before the tool call, and after the tool response I write the final message. The final message must have PM_RESULT as last nonempty line. Actually simpler: emit explanation + PM_RESULT now, then call goal complete? No — tool calls come at end of message typically, and stop sequence halts. The format guide: write the call, THEN the stop sequence, THEN halt. If I put text +   [0m[37;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mPM_RESULT + tool call, the tool response arrives, then I need another turn to finalize — but then my final message's last line must be the PM_RESULT line again? The requirement: "the final nonempty line must be exactly one PM_RESULT [39;38;5;248m<minified JSON>[39;38;5;248m line." If I emit PM_RESULT, then call goal complete, then respond with something after, the final line wouldn't be PM_RESULT unless I repeat it.[39m                                                                                                          [0m[38;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[39;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mCleanest: first message: brief explanation + PM_RESULT line as last line, no tool calls. Then optionally call goal complete in a subsequent action? But each assistant message ends either with text or a tool call. If I end with text only, turn yields without completing the goal. The goa