trol returns to user; I never get to call goal complete. Unless the harness lets me continue after text? No — ending message without tool call = yield. So Option A it is.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                   [0m[62;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[63;1H[0m[K [38;5;248mExplanation content — keep terse per persona. Then the JSON values grounded in receipts.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           [0m[64;1H                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [0m[65;1H [38;5;248mOne more check on field ordering: schema_id, source